---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Kemtan's blogKuliah</h1>
			<p>
				Hi, this is where i store all my knowledge after college class.
				I made this blog because i can't stand powerpoint style format when learning.
				I hope this blog can help someone like me, thanks
			</p>
			<p>
				Language: mostly in english, but some are indonesian
			</p>
			<p>Subject:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Pengantar Sistem Digital</li>
				<li>Matematika Diskret</li>
				<li>Kalkulus</li>
				<li>C and C++</li>
				<li>Python</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Have fun! If you get stuck, remember to{' '}
				<a href="https://docs.astro.build/">be kind to yourself</a>{' '}
				. If you have any question, u can chat me on <a href="https://astro.build/chat">discord</a>.
				. Oh yeah, this site is free from AI, all pure written by me and my thoughts.
			</p>
			<p>
				Also this website is open source, u can contribute here on {' '}
				<a href="https://github.com/Charca/astro-blog-template">github</a>{' '}
				lisensed by <a href="https://twitter.com/Charca">MIT LISENSE</a>.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
